**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery Mission**

| **Name**                                     | **Text**                                                                                                    | **Runtime**                                      | **Goal Type** | **Enquired Information / Target Condition**             | **Relation** | **Justification**                                                                                                                                           | **Ground truth I** | **Ground truth C** | **Ground truth E** |
| -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------ | ------------------ |
| **G1 – DeliverFoodToInpatient**              | Deliver a meal from the kitchen to an inpatient’s room.                                                     | `;`                                              | Perform       | –                                                       | AND          | The entire mission is a sequence of steps that must be executed in order: receive request → decide method → open door → deliver → monitor → alert → record. | Achieve. Target condition: all food was delivered.                   |                    |                    |
