| **G7 – AlertWrongMeal**                      | Alert the staff if the wrong meal is retrieved.                                                             | `-`                                              | Perform       | –                                                       | AND          | Prevents patient receiving an incorrect meal.                                                                                                               | OK                   |                    |                    |
| **G9 – FoodDeliveredToPatient**              | Confirm that the meal has been successfully delivered to the patient (either placed on table or retrieved). | `-`                                              | Achieve       | “Meal has been received by patient or placed on table.” | AND          | This is the final world-state goal that the robot must bring about.                                                                                         |                    |    OK                |                    |


