### Task Model

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** | **Justification** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|-------------------|
| **AT1 – ReceiveKitchenRequestTask** | Receive the kitchen order. | AND | Kitchen | 1 | The robot must physically receive the order before planning. |
| **AT2 – QueryPatientRetrievalCapabilityTask** | Query the patient record for retrieval capability. | AND | Hospital information system | 1 | The robot needs this data to decide the delivery method. |
| **AT3 – UnassistedDishRetrievalTask** | Robot retrieves dishes alone. | AND | Patient room | 1 | When the robot can lift/carry dishes without help. |
| **AT4 – RobotCooperativeDishRetrievalTask** | Robot cooperates with another robot to retrieve dishes. | AND | Patient room | 2 | Needed when a single robot’s payload is insufficient. |
| **AT5 – HumanCooperativeDishRetrievalTask** | Robot cooperates with a human to retrieve dishes. | AND | Patient room | 1 | Needed when a human is available to help. |
| **AT6 – NotifyPatientToRetrieveMealTask** | Notify the patient that the meal is ready on the tray. | AND | Patient room | 1 | The patient must know when to collect the meal. |
| **AT7 – PlaceMealOnTableTask** | Place the meal on the patient’s table using manipulation skill. | AND | Patient room table | 1 | Requires the robot’s manipulation skill. |
| **AT8 – RobotOpenDoorTask** | Robot opens the patient’s room door. | AND | Patient room door | 1 | When the robot can operate the door. |
| **AT9 – HumanOpenDoorTask** | Human opens the patient’s room door. | AND | Patient room door | 1 | When a human is present and willing. |
| **AT10 – MonitorMealRetrievalTask** | Monitor the patient’s meal retrieval. | AND | Patient room | 1 | Needed to detect wrong or missed retrieval. |
| **AT11 – AlertWrongMealTask** | Alert staff if the wrong meal is retrieved. | AND | Patient room | 1 | Prevents patient receiving incorrect meal. |
| **AT12 – TrackMealDeliveryTask** | Log the meal delivery event. | AND | Hospital information system | 1 | Records the successful delivery for audit. |

